{
  "about": "The editing evaluation set (technical design section 12, SP-5; spec section 10: targeting accuracy >= 90%). Each request runs alone, in a fresh project with its deck. Slides are numbered as in the deck before the request. expect: edit {slide: [roles]} - exactly these slides change, and on each only the shapes of these roles (title, subtitle, body, left, right, table, picture, group, notes, any); add {count, after}; delete [slides]; move {slide, to}; none (a question about the deck: nothing changes); ask (too vague: the assistant asks before changing anything). check: what the result must say (contains / absent per slide; 'new' is the first added slide) - reported apart from targeting. answer: what the person replies if the assistant asks.",
  "decks": {
    "report": "fixtures/eval/report.pptx",
    "onboarding": "fixtures/eval/onboarding.pptx",
    "marketing": "fixtures/eval/marketing.pptx",
